WEBVTT

00:00:21.790 --> 00:00:25.190
We're still alive, right?

00:00:25.840 --> 00:00:28.530
Yeah.

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:34.010
It's fortunate that the car was robust.

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:39.740
When I die, I'd prefer to do so
alone with Tomoe-chan.

00:00:43.570 --> 00:00:45.230
It was my first time driving!

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.020
Everyone goes through this!

00:00:47.200 --> 00:00:52.380
Anyway, ladies — now we'll commence with the inaugural annual Girls' Club Summer Camp!

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.530
You only get one summer as a freshman!

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:57.450
Let's have a blast!

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.830
The copies are done!

00:02:57.450 --> 00:03:00.100
Take care not to get a paper cut.

00:03:00.100 --> 00:03:03.000
I have gloves on, so I'll be fine.

00:03:03.740 --> 00:03:05.940
Still, we've got a lot here.

00:03:06.340 --> 00:03:10.680
Have you always done this
by yourself before, Aoi-san?

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:16.900
It'd have been quicker to have a print shop do it,
but it would've cost a lot more.

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:20.380
You should've asked a friend to help you.

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:31.200
B-But things went smoothly this time, since you were here with me.

00:03:31.940 --> 00:03:33.900
There are a lot of pages as well.

00:03:34.270 --> 00:03:37.860
In the past, she used to make me
stay up all night to help her.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:40.570
Geez, Mother!

00:03:41.110 --> 00:03:43.260
We're fine, so stay out of the way!

00:03:43.700 --> 00:03:44.570
Okay, okay!

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:47.160
Let me know if you want more.

00:03:47.160 --> 00:03:48.090
We get it!

00:03:56.500 --> 00:03:58.810
The weather sure is nice.

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:05.110
What am I doing here?

00:04:10.310 --> 00:04:11.620
In reality...

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.140
Today, I did my homework with Kazama!

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.820
Kazama came to my house for a sleep over!

00:04:24.990 --> 00:04:27.010
We went to the summer festival!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:30.300
We went to the beach...

00:04:32.080 --> 00:04:33.470
...and the mountains!

00:04:36.920 --> 00:04:38.100
We hugged...

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.370
...and kissed!

00:04:42.920 --> 00:04:45.680
Or so it should've been!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.620
All right, let's get started.

00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.640
Let's get this over with quickly.

00:04:52.640 --> 00:04:54.910
We have other preparations to see to as well.

00:05:06.450 --> 00:05:11.300
I wonder if Kazama and the others have arrived at the beach already.

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:22.360
I'm sure she looks great in that brand new bikini!

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:31.820
Perhaps I should've left Aoi-san
behind and gone with them.

00:05:35.020 --> 00:05:36.440
Wait up!

00:05:36.440 --> 00:05:38.080
This way! This way!

00:05:38.560 --> 00:05:40.150
I'm going to get you!

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:41.580
Oh no!

00:05:43.400 --> 00:05:45.540
I got you!

00:05:45.540 --> 00:05:47.510
I've been caught!

00:05:51.580 --> 00:05:55.810
And then, the promised accident!

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:01.000
I won't allow something like that to happen without me present!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:02.270
Murasame-san?

00:06:11.470 --> 00:06:12.670
What's wrong?

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:18.980
Oh, right. I promised I'd help
her make the book...

00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:23.130
...but I didn't agree to attend
the event tomorrow — I think.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.030
Which means...

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:28.650
It's nothing to worry about!

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:31.030
Let's rip through this!

00:06:32.830 --> 00:06:35.640
You mustn't rip the paper!

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:43.730
Murasame-san?

00:06:53.220 --> 00:06:55.430
I'm going to rush through this...

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.370
...and catch that accident!

00:07:04.650 --> 00:07:07.230
That was quite the accident.

00:07:07.230 --> 00:07:12.200
Still, be at ease — we didn't bother anyone—

00:07:17.950 --> 00:07:19.560
Understood.

00:07:23.210 --> 00:07:26.520
We've been told to come back — at once.

00:07:26.960 --> 00:07:28.810
What did you expect?

00:07:30.260 --> 00:07:34.720
All right! With this, we'll conclude the inaugural annual Girls' Club Summer Camp!

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:38.350
Good thing we left our bags at the inn.

00:07:38.350 --> 00:07:40.030
I guess so.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.620
F-From where?

00:07:49.570 --> 00:07:51.200
Still not done, huh?

00:07:53.450 --> 00:07:57.240
It's just folding paper, but there's no end to it.

00:07:58.040 --> 00:08:01.010
Well, there are a lot of pages this time.

00:08:01.010 --> 00:08:06.770
Even though you didn't have to, you worked hard and wrote 50 pages, Murasame-san.

00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:09.770
You reap what you sow, huh?

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:13.730
Murasame-san, could you close
your eyes for a moment?

00:08:15.390 --> 00:08:16.470
Why?

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.860
Just for a bit.

00:08:28.480 --> 00:08:29.530
I'm ready.

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:32.670
What do you think?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.680
About what?

00:08:41.280 --> 00:08:43.540
Geez! This uniform!

00:08:43.790 --> 00:08:46.210
It's the one from "Seigetsu Girls' High School"!

00:08:49.550 --> 00:08:51.800
I'm going to wear this tomorrow!

00:08:51.800 --> 00:08:54.020
Ah, cosplay.

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:58.110
Do they sell those?

00:08:58.110 --> 00:08:59.560
I made it!

00:08:59.970 --> 00:09:04.030
I found a uniform similar to it
and made a few alterations.

00:09:05.520 --> 00:09:07.610
That's amazing.

00:09:07.610 --> 00:09:09.750
Her passion, that is.

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:13.820
This one is yours, Murasame-san!

00:09:15.570 --> 00:09:16.770
Me too?

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:18.070
Yeah!

00:09:18.070 --> 00:09:20.340
We'll have fun tomorrow!

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:27.080
Well, since you've gone to such lengths,
I feel obligated to go.

00:09:29.750 --> 00:09:30.770
I...

00:09:32.130 --> 00:09:33.480
...was really happy.

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:42.850
To begin with, it was a misunderstanding on my part that got you involved in this.

00:09:44.100 --> 00:09:47.370
Yet you went along with it
without a single complaint.

00:09:48.270 --> 00:09:51.420
Time and time again, you gave it your all.

00:09:54.990 --> 00:09:58.090
Thank you ever so much, Murasame-san.

00:10:01.180 --> 00:10:02.470
Don't mention it...

00:10:03.610 --> 00:10:06.870
All right! Now that we've had a break,
let's finish the rest!

00:10:06.870 --> 00:10:09.020
Yeah, there are only a few more to go.

00:10:14.260 --> 00:10:16.260
I'm sorry, Aoi-san.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:18.780
I really do want...

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:24.030
...to be there for the accident!

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.730
The training camp lasts until we're home!

00:10:33.520 --> 00:10:37.710
Make sure not to shame
the Girls' Club until the very end!

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:43.130
I'm fine with anything
as long as I'm with you, Tomoe-chan...

00:10:43.530 --> 00:10:46.140
...but next time it'd be nice to visit a hot spring.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:49.400
That'd be perfect for winter.

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:52.500
It seems like we'll somehow
make it back tonight.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:54.650
That's great.

00:10:55.300 --> 00:10:57.250
Tomorrow's free.

00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:00.610
Shall we pay a visit to that
event Murasame-san's attending?

00:11:14.690 --> 00:11:16.110
All right!

00:11:16.650 --> 00:11:19.030
Once we bind them together,
we'll be good to go.

00:11:19.030 --> 00:11:21.290
This is quite the first issue.

00:11:21.590 --> 00:11:24.120
With this many, it might take us all night!

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:27.540
We're young, so an all-nighter is nothing!

00:11:28.060 --> 00:11:30.290
All right, let's get to it!

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:36.520
If I take the first train, I'll have two days — two full days to have fun with Kazama!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.380
This character is wrong.

00:11:44.600 --> 00:11:46.010
Well...

00:11:46.010 --> 00:11:48.620
It's just one character, though...

00:11:49.980 --> 00:11:51.620
...and it's only a doujinshi.

00:11:52.350 --> 00:11:54.730
It's normal to have a typo or two, right?

00:11:54.730 --> 00:11:57.170
Y-Yeah...

00:12:09.080 --> 00:12:11.540
It's no use; I can't ignore it!

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:15.630
If we've come this far — this far — then we can't have a single mistake!

00:12:16.010 --> 00:12:18.500
It's fine, Murasame-san! It's fine!

00:12:18.920 --> 00:12:21.970
There's no such thing
as a perfect human being!

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.550
You seem to be quite busy;
would you like me to help?

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.760
No, this is all my fault!

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:38.250
Oh, come to think of it, the toner is...

00:12:41.440 --> 00:12:45.210
I'm sorry, but our copy machine
is broken at the moment.

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:48.800
Let's try the next one!

00:12:54.420 --> 00:12:57.290
Ah, we have a paper jam.

00:12:57.920 --> 00:12:59.230
Let's see...

00:12:59.550 --> 00:13:03.300
How do I do this...?

00:13:04.680 --> 00:13:08.680
Please excuse me for a moment while I look for the instruction manual.

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:10.570
Next!

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.690
Why is there a queue at this hour?!

00:13:17.690 --> 00:13:20.170
No, it must be for that very reason!

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:22.710
Next!

00:13:31.120 --> 00:13:32.810
Finally!

00:13:32.810 --> 00:13:36.520
We can get it done, at long last.

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:41.190
Excuse me!

00:13:41.190 --> 00:13:42.340
I'm back!

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:45.520
All right, copies coming through!

00:13:46.260 --> 00:13:49.300
Fold and bind! Fold and bind!

00:13:49.320 --> 00:13:51.610
I'll be with you as soon as I'm done here.

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:52.720
Wait for me, Kazama!

00:13:53.310 --> 00:13:55.730
Wait for me, accident!

00:13:57.230 --> 00:14:01.830
Is this where the accident will take place?!

00:14:02.860 --> 00:14:03.820
Murasame-san!

00:14:06.950 --> 00:14:07.950
This is bad!

00:14:07.950 --> 00:14:10.730
At this angle we're going to collide!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:14.830
The bed!

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.830
If I change my course, I can avoid a collision!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.720
I did it!

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.360
Success!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:38.490
Good work, you two.

00:14:39.190 --> 00:14:39.730
Mother!
Why don't you have some—

00:14:39.730 --> 00:14:41.460
Why don't you have some—

00:15:10.180 --> 00:15:11.820
I'm sorry...

00:15:12.970 --> 00:15:15.870
...that the camp turned out like this.

00:15:16.190 --> 00:15:17.790
Don't be.

00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.350
Really, it's just like a comedy.

00:15:28.990 --> 00:15:32.530
If we can laugh about it,
then it was a good experience.

00:15:34.450 --> 00:15:35.760
I see.

00:15:36.200 --> 00:15:38.600
You can look at it that way as well.

00:15:46.170 --> 00:15:49.690
Still, I think Murasame-kun
will be happy about this.

00:15:51.300 --> 00:15:54.070
She'll be able to see you sooner than she thought.

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:01.620
Sumi-chan... wouldn't laugh at the misfortune of others.

00:16:12.610 --> 00:16:14.070
What are you doing?!

00:16:14.700 --> 00:16:16.490
Didn't I tell you to leave us alone?!

00:16:16.490 --> 00:16:17.330
Aoi-san!

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:19.800
S-Sorry...

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.100
I'm so sorry, Azusa.

00:16:23.750 --> 00:16:27.210
I'm so sorry, Murasame-san. It's all my fault.

00:16:27.210 --> 00:16:29.800
Don't worry. More importantly, are you hurt?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.550
We're fine.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:33.580
It's not fine!

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:35.070
Aoi-san!

00:16:40.930 --> 00:16:42.730
It isn't...

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.940
It isn't!

00:16:55.500 --> 00:16:58.620
We worked... so hard...

00:17:01.250 --> 00:17:03.180
We won't make it, now.

00:17:11.880 --> 00:17:13.170
Azusa...

00:17:38.740 --> 00:17:39.930
At any rate...

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:45.040
...we first need to separate
the good ones from the rest

00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.920
and then put them back in order.

00:17:48.580 --> 00:17:49.850
But...

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:52.550
It's fine, even if it's only one or two books.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:55.170
We'll finish them and go to the event.

00:17:56.610 --> 00:17:58.380
This is our book!

00:17:58.690 --> 00:18:01.930
I won't allow you to simply give up!

00:18:08.190 --> 00:18:09.450
You're right.

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:17.480
Um, can I lend you a hand as well?

00:18:19.700 --> 00:18:21.700
I'll bring a towel.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.340
I'm sorry, Kazama.

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.430
I won't make it this time.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:07.500
It's so hot!

00:19:09.290 --> 00:19:13.000
Are these all girls who like each other?

00:19:13.280 --> 00:19:16.840
Well, just how they like each other may vary.

00:19:16.840 --> 00:19:20.010
Ushio-chan should've come along too.

00:19:20.010 --> 00:19:22.940
There are so many girls like her here.

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:27.140
She's just upset that Big Brow
took her girl from her.

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:28.740
No...

00:19:29.600 --> 00:19:31.140
...it might not be like that.

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:42.030
It's Ushio-chan.

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:44.410
What's that? Some kind of disguise?

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:47.050
That booth...

00:20:10.730 --> 00:20:12.190
Welcome!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.080
K-Kazama?!

00:20:19.440 --> 00:20:23.450
W-Wh-Why are you here?

00:20:24.490 --> 00:20:28.550
What happened to the camp?

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:31.790
...came home.

00:20:31.790 --> 00:20:34.460
Wh-What?

00:20:35.290 --> 00:20:38.460
I came home because I
wanted to see you, Sumi-chan.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.980
Murasame-san—

00:20:55.150 --> 00:20:57.750
Murasame-san?

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:05.630
What were you two talking about before?

00:21:07.820 --> 00:21:09.590
That's a secret.

00:21:12.120 --> 00:21:13.940
Unexpectedly, she's...

00:21:13.940 --> 00:21:15.850
...quite the tease.

00:23:15.740 --> 00:23:18.000
Are the back issues sold out?

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:18.840
Ah, I'm sorry...

00:23:18.840 --> 00:23:21.080
I'd like the new issue, please!

00:23:21.080 --> 00:23:22.700
Thank you very much!

00:23:22.700 --> 00:23:24.460
I came all the way from Kyushu!

00:23:24.460 --> 00:23:26.640
Lately it's been getting
more and more interesting!

00:23:26.640 --> 00:23:28.550
I'd like this and this, please.

00:23:28.550 --> 00:23:30.310
Thank you.

00:23:30.310 --> 00:23:32.030
I have exactly 2,000 yen!

00:23:32.800 --> 00:23:33.930
I've been a fan for so long!

00:23:33.930 --> 00:23:34.850
Good luck!

00:23:34.850 --> 00:23:35.930
Thank you.

00:23:37.060 --> 00:23:39.060
We're going to the pool next week!

00:23:39.060 --> 00:23:39.890
You know...

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:42.730
Plenty of ripe young girls in swimsuits!

00:23:42.730 --> 00:23:45.980
Could it be that Kazama won't appear in the preview?

00:23:45.980 --> 00:23:48.880
Don't let all the rapid-fire sexy shots give you heartburn!

00:23:49.440 --> 00:23:51.250
Kazama!
